### User B deletes user A's post -> 403
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/post/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{benToken}}

### No token -> 401
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/post/{{postId}}

### User A deletes own post -> 200 "Post deleted successfully"
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/post/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{annaToken}}

### Delete again -> 404
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/post/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{annaToken}}
